<Layout title="About Vishvendra Tomar"><article class="entry"><h1>About Tomar</h1><p class="lede">I’m Vishvendra Pratap Singh Tomar, a backend engineer in India. I build AI systems and the backend around them.</p><h2>Working across borders</h2><p>I spent about a year and a half building a staffing platform for the Belgian market. I worked remotely from Bengaluru and spent about 20 days in Belgium for final delivery.</p><h2>GeekyAnts</h2><p>I progressed from Software Engineer I to Software Engineer III. My work covered staffing software, agent infrastructure and backend development. On Ant Agents I owned the agent infrastructure and scaling work and built most of the backend.</p><p>I’ve also worked on AI developer tooling and with LangGraph and LangChain. My degree is a Bachelor of Computer Applications (BCA).</p><h2>Tools I work with</h2><p>Python, FastAPI, TypeScript, Node.js, NestJS, Next.js, PostgreSQL, Firestore, Redis, Docker, AWS and Azure DevOps.</p><a href="/work/">Explore my work</a></article></Layout>
